#. <span class="hint">@T["If checked, the shop won't verify that every product in the cart has a valid Tax part. If you check this, you are responsible for verifying that all taxable product types have attached and correctly configured tax parts."]</span>
#: OrchardCore.Commerce.Tax/Views/TaxSettings_Edit.cshtml:8
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Commerce.Tax.Views.TaxSettings_Edit"
msgid "If checked, the shop won't verify that every product in the cart has a valid Tax part. If you check this, you are responsible for verifying that all taxable product types have attached and correctly configured tax parts."
msgstr "Se selezionato, il negozio non verificherà che ogni prodotto in carrello abbia una TaxPart valida. Se selezioni questa opzione, sei responsabile di verificare che tutti i tipi di prodotti tassabili abbiano allegato e correttamente configurato le TaxPart."

